; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swa-der-transport-access-type)
; AVP: Transport-Access-Type
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Command-Section: 4.2.2.1.1
; Section: 4.1.2.1.1
; Table: 4.1.2.1/1
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"if the access network needs to receive the IMSI of the UE in the authentication response, then this information element shall be present, and it shall contain the value \"BBF\" (see clause 5.2.3.19)."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swa-der-auth-request-type)
; AVP: Auth-Request-Type
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Command-Section: 4.2.2.1.1
; Section: 4.1.2.1.1
; Table: 4.1.2.1/1
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"AUTHORIZE_AUTHENTICATE shall be used in this case."
    range 3


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swa-der-anid)
; AVP: ANID
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Command-Section: 4.2.2.1.1
; Section: 4.1.2.1.1
; Table: 4.1.2.1/1
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be included if the non-3GPP access network selects the EAP-AKA' authentication method."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swa-der-high-priority-access-info)
; AVP: High-Priority-Access-Info
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Command-Section: 4.2.2.1.1
; Section: 4.1.2.1.1
; Table: 4.1.2.1/1
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be sent to the 3GPP AAA Server if the UE has access priority"
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swa-dea-auth-request-type)
; AVP: Auth-Request-Type
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Command-Section: 4.2.2.1.2
; Section: 4.1.2.1.1
; Table: 4.1.2.1/2
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain the value AUTHORIZE_AUTHENTICATE."
    range 3


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swa-dea-eap-master-session-key)
; AVP: EAP-Master-Session-Key
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Command-Section: 4.2.2.1.2
; Section: 4.1.2.1.1
; Table: 4.1.2.1/2
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall be present if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    present-if Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swa-dea-redirect-host)
; AVP: Redirect-Host
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Command-Section: 4.2.2.1.2
; Section: 4.1.2.1.1
; Table: 4.1.2.1/2
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be present if the Result-Code value is set to DIAMETER_REDIRECT_INDICATION."
    present-if Result-Code = DIAMETER_REDIRECT_INDICATION


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swa-dea-an-trusted)
; AVP: AN-Trusted
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Command-Section: 4.2.2.1.2
; Section: 4.1.2.1.1
; Table: 4.1.2.1/2
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"For the SWa case, the value \"UNTRUSTED\" shall be used."
    range 1


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swa-dea-mobile-node-identifier)
; AVP: Mobile-Node-Identifier
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Command-Section: 4.2.2.1.2
; Request-Section: 4.2.2.1.1
; Section: 4.1.2.1.1
; Table: 4.1.2.1/2
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall only be sent if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS and if the Transport Access Type in the request command indicated that the UE is accessing the EPC from a Fixed Broadband access network"
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS
    requires request/Transport-Access-Type = BBF
"This IE shall not include the leading digit prepended in front of the IMSI used to differentiate between authentication schemes."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swa-dea-mps-priority)
; AVP: MPS-Priority
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Command-Section: 4.2.2.1.2
; Section: 4.1.2.1.1
; Table: 4.1.2.1/2
; Page: 18
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be sent to the non-3GPP WLAN access if the UE has an MPS subscription in the HSS."
    text-only


