; Section: 5.1.2.3.1
; Table: 5.1.2.3.1/3
; Page: 51
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Based on operator policy, this information element shall be sent to the 3GPP AAA Server if the UE has access priority"
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#sta-aaa-auth-request-type)
; AVP: Auth-Request-Type
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Section: 5.1.2.3.1
; Table: 5.1.2.3.1/4
; Page: 51
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
