; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#sta-aaa-context-identifier)
; AVP: Context-Identifier
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Section: 5.1.2.3.1
; Table: 5.1.2.3.1/4
; Page: 51
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall only be included if NBM is authorized for use, the Emergency-Indication AVP was not present in the initial Authentication and Authorization Answer and the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#sta-aaa-apn-oi-replacement)
; AVP: APN-OI-Replacement
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Section: 5.1.2.3.1
; Table: 5.1.2.3.1/4
; Page: 51
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall only be included if NBM is authorized for use, the Emergency-Indication bit of the Emergency-Services AVP was not set in the initial Authentication and Authorization Answer and the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#sta-aaa-apn-configuration)
; AVP: APN-Configuration
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Section: 5.1.2.3.1
; Table: 5.1.2.3.1/4
; Page: 51
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
