    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#sta-aaa-ambr)
; AVP: AMBR
; Section: 5.1.2.3.1
; Table: 5.1.2.3.1/4
; Page: 51
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS and ANID is \"HRPD\"."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#sta-aaa-mip6-feature-vector)
; AVP: MIP6-Feature-Vector
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Command-Section: 5.2.2.3.4
; Section: 5.1.2.3.1
; Table: 5.1.2.3.1/4
; Page: 51
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall only be sent if it has been received in the corresponding authorization request and the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires request/MIP6-Feature-Vector and Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS
"When included, the PMIP_SUPPORTED and the OPTIMIZED_IDLE_MODE_MOBILITY flags shall be set."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#sta-aaa-trace-info)
; AVP: Trace-Info
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Section: 5.1.2.3.1
; Table: 5.1.2.3.1/4
; Page: 51
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be included if the subscriber and equipment trace has been activated for the user in the HSS and signalling based activation is used to download the trace activation from the HSS to the trusted non-3GPP access network."
    text-only
"Only the Trace-Data AVP shall be included to the Trace-Info AVP"
    members only Trace-Data


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#sta-aaa-subscription-id)
; AVP: Subscription-Id
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Section: 5.1.2.3.1
; Table: 5.1.2.3.1/4
; Page: 51
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall contain the MSISDN of the UE and shall be sent if it is available and the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Subscription-Id/Subscription-Id-Type = END_USER_E164


