; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Page: 94
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Based on operator policy, this information element shall be sent to the ePDG if the UE has an MPS subscription in the HSS."
    text-only


; Type: Information Elements
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264 ;; corrected: (TS29.273.py#elements-application-7-1-2-2-1-1)
