; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/1
; Page: 107
; Columns: Name               AVP                         Cat
"Permanent User Identity"     User-Name                   M
"Request Type"                "Auth-Request -Type"        M
"AAR Flags"                   AAR-Flags                   O
"UE local IP address"         UE-Local-IP-Address         C
