; Type: Information Elements
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264 ;; corrected: (TS29.273.py#elements-application-7-1-2-2-1-2)
; From: RFC4005
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Page: 107
; Columns: Name               AVP                                       Cat
"Permanent User Identity"     User-Name                                 M
"Request Type"                "Auth-Request -Type"                      M
"Registration Result"         "Result-Code/ Experimental Result Code"   M
"UE IPv4 Home Address"        PMIP6-IPv4-Home-Address                   O
"APN-OI replacement"          APN-OI-Replacement                        C
"APN and PGW Data"            APN-Configuration                         C
"Trace information"           Trace-Info                                C
