"WLAN Location Information"   Access-Network-Info                       O
"WLAN Location Timestamp"     User-Location-Info-Time                   C
"Core Network Restrictions"   Core-Network-Restrictions                 C
"MPS Priority"                MPS-Priority                              C


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aar-auth-request-type)
; AVP: Auth-Request-Type
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/1
; Page: 107
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall have the value AUTHORIZE_ONLY."
    range 2


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aar-ue-local-ip-address)
; AVP: UE-Local-IP-Address
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/1
; Page: 107
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall be present if the ePDG provided the UE Local IP address in the initial Authentication and Authorization Request and the UE Local IP address has changed."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aar-high-priority-access-info)
; AVP: High-Priority-Access-Info
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/1
; Page: 107
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Based on operator policy, this information element shall be sent to the 3GPP AAA Server if the UE has access priority"
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aaa-auth-request-type)
; AVP: Auth-Request-Type
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Page: 107
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain the value AUTHORIZE_ONLY."
    range 2


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aaa-apn-oi-replacement)
; AVP: APN-OI-Replacement
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Page: 107
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall only be included if NBM is used, the Emergency-Indication bit of the Emergency-Services AVP was not set in the initial Authentication and Authorization Request, and the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aaa-apn-configuration)
; AVP: APN-Configuration
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Page: 107
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall only be sent if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS and the Emergency-Indication bit of the Emergency-Services AVP was not set in the initial Authentication and Authorization Request."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aaa-trace-info)
; AVP: Trace-Info
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Page: 107
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be included if the subscriber and equipment trace has been activated for the user in the HSS and signalling based activation is used to download the trace activation from the HSS to the ePDG."
    text-only
"Only the Trace-Data AVP shall be included if trace activation is requested. Only the Trace-Reference AVP shall be included if trace deactivation is requested."
    members only Trace-Data Trace-Reference


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aaa-subscription-id)
; AVP: Subscription-Id
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Page: 107
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall contain the MSISDN of the UE and shall be sent only if it is available."
    requires Subscription-Id/Subscription-Id-Type = END_USER_E164


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aaa-user-location-info-time)
; AVP: User-Location-Info-Time
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Page: 107
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE should be present if the WLAN Location Information IE is present."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aaa-core-network-restrictions)
; AVP: Core-Network-Restrictions
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Page: 107
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall be present if this information is available in the user subscription."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swm-aaa-mps-priority)
