"If the 3GPP AAA Server knows the HSS name, this AVP shall be present."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-mar-anid)
; AVP: ANID
; Command: Multimedia-Auth-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.1.1
; Table: 8.1.2.1.1/1
; Page: 125
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall be present if the Authentication Method is EAP-AKA'."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-maa-user-name-imsi)
; AVP: User-Name
; Command: Multimedia-Auth-Answer
; Section: 8.1.2.1.1
; Table: 8.1.2.1.1/4
; Page: 125
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall contain the user IMSI, formatted according to"
    encoding digits
    length 6..15 digits


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-maa-sip-number-auth-items)
; AVP: SIP-Number-Auth-Items
; Command: Multimedia-Auth-Answer
; Section: 8.1.2.1.1
; Table: 8.1.2.1.1/4
; Page: 125
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present when the result is DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    present-if Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS
"This AVP shall indicate the number of authentication vectors delivered in the Authentication Data information element."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-maa-sip-auth-data-item)
; AVP: SIP-Auth-Data-Item
; Command: Multimedia-Auth-Answer
; Section: 8.1.2.1.1
; Table: 8.1.2.1.1/4
; Page: 125
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"If the SIP-Number-Auth-Items AVP is equal to zero or it is not present, then this AVP shall not be present."
    requires SIP-Number-Auth-Items
    absent-if SIP-Number-Auth-Items = 0


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-maa-3gpp-aaa-server-name)
; AVP: 3GPP-AAA-Server-Name
; Command: Multimedia-Auth-Answer
; Section: 8.1.2.1.1
; Table: 8.1.2.1.1/4
; Page: 125
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be sent when the user has been previously authenticated by another 3GPP AAA Server and therefore there is another 3GPP AAA Server serving the user."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sip-auth-data-item-sip-item-number)
; AVP: SIP-Item-Number
; Within: SIP-Auth-Data-Item
; Section: 8.1.2.1.1
; Table: 8.1.2.1.1/5
; Page: 125
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be present in a SIP-Auth-Data-Item grouped AVP in circumstances where there are multiple occurrences of SIP-Auth-Data-Item AVPs, and the order in which they should be processed is significant."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sip-auth-data-item-sip-authentication-scheme)
; AVP: SIP-Authentication-Scheme
; Within: SIP-Auth-Data-Item
; Application-ID: 16777265
; Section: 8.1.2.1.1
; Table: 8.1.2.1.1/2
; Page: 125
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain one of the values EAP-AKA or EAP-AKA'."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sip-auth-data-item-sip-authenticate)
; AVP: SIP-Authenticate
; Within: SIP-Auth-Data-Item
; Application-ID: 16777265
; Section: 8.1.2.1.1
; Table: 8.1.2.1.1/5
; Page: 125
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall contain, binary encoded, the concatenation of the authentication challenge RAND and the token AUTN."
    length 32 octets


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sip-auth-data-item-sip-authorization)
; AVP: SIP-Authorization
; Within: SIP-Auth-Data-Item
; Application-ID: 16777265
; Section: 8.1.2.1.1
; Table: 8.1.2.1.1/5
; Page: 125
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall contain binary encoded, the expected response XRES."
    text-only


