"Registration result"                            Result-Code/Experimental-Result   M
"User Profile"                                   Non-3GPP-User-Data                C
"3GPP AAA Server Name"                           "3GPP-AAA- Server-Name"           C
"Supported Features (See 3GPP TS 29.229 [24])"   Supported-Features                O


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sar-user-name-imsi)
; AVP: User-Name
; Command: Server-Assignment-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall contain the user IMSI and shall be formatted according to"
    encoding digits
    length 6..15 digits


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sar-server-assignment-type)
; AVP: Server-Assignment-Type
; Command: Server-Assignment-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Any other value shall be considered as an error case."
    range 1..14
    exclude 2, 3, 4, 6, 7, 11


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sar-destination-host)
; AVP: Destination-Host
; Command: Server-Assignment-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"If the 3GPP AAA Server knows the HSS name this AVP shall be present."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sar-mip6-agent-info)
; AVP: MIP6-Agent-Info
; Command: Server-Assignment-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall contain, either the identity of the dynamically allocated PDN GW, or the identity of a dynamically allocated PDN GW selected for the establishment of emergency PDN connections, and is included if the Server-Assignment-Type is set to PGW_UPDATE."
    present-if Server-Assignment-Type = 13
    members at-least-one MIP-Home-Agent-Address MIP-Home-Agent-Host


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sar-context-identifier)
; AVP: Context-Identifier
; Command: Server-Assignment-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"For emergency PDN connection establishment, this information element shall be left absent."
    absent-if Emergency-Services bit Emergency-Indication


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sar-visited-network-identifier)
; AVP: Visited-Network-Identifier
; Command: Server-Assignment-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present when the PGW Identity is present and does not contain an FQDN."
    present-if MIP6-Agent-Info and not MIP6-Agent-Info/MIP-Home-Agent-Host


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sar-service-selection)
; AVP: Service-Selection
; Command: Server-Assignment-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"For non-emergency PDN connection establishment, this information element shall contain the Network Identifier part of the APN, and it shall be included if the Server-Assignment-Type is set to PGW_UPDATE."
    present-if Server-Assignment-Type = PGW_UPDATE and not Emergency-Services bit Emergency-Indication
"For emergency PDN connection establishment, this information element shall be left absent."
    absent-if Emergency-Services bit Emergency-Indication


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sar-terminal-information)
; AVP: Terminal-Information
; Command: Server-Assignment-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The 3GPP AAA Server shall include this IE and set it to the user's Mobile Equipment Identity, if this information is available, and if the Server-Assignment-Type is set to REGISTRATION."
"This IE shall also be present, independently of the value of the Server-Assignment-Type, if the Terminal-Information has changed from the last value previously reported to the HSS."
"This grouped AVP shall contain the IMEI AVP and, if available, the Software-Version AVP, for a trusted or untrusted WLAN access."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-sar-emergency-services)
; AVP: Emergency-Services
; Command: Server-Assignment-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The 3GPP AAA Server shall include this information element, and set the Emergency-Indication bit, to notify the HSS that a new PDN-GW has been selected for the establishment of an emergency PDN connection"
    bits set 0
"This IE shall only be included when the Server-Assignment-Type is set to PGW_UPDATE."
    requires Server-Assignment-Type = 13


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-saa-user-name-imsi)
; AVP: User-Name
; Command: Server-Assignment-Answer
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall contain the user IMSI and shall be formatted according to"
    encoding digits
    length 6..15 digits


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-saa-non-3gpp-user-data)
; AVP: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Command: Server-Assignment-Answer
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present when Server-Assignment-Type in the request is equal to AAA_USER_DATA_REQUEST or REGISTRATION and the Result-Code is equal to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    present-if request/Server-Assignment-Type = AAA_USER_DATA_REQUEST and Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS or request/Server-Assignment-Type = REGISTRATION and Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-saa-3gpp-aaa-server-name)
; AVP: 3GPP-AAA-Server-Name
; Command: Server-Assignment-Answer
; Section: 8.1.2.2.2.1
; Table: 8.1.2.2.2.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be present when the user has been previously authenticated by another 3GPP AAA Server and therefore there is another 3GPP AAA Server serving the user."
    text-only


