; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-ppr-non-3gpp-user-data)
; AVP: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Command: Push-Profile-Request
; Section: 8.1.2.3.2
; Page: 137
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"In this case, the HSS shall set the \"P-CSCF Restoration Request\" bit in the PPR Flags and the procedure shall only be used for the purpose of the P-CSCF restoration for WLAN; then, the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP shall be included as an empty AVP."
