; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"For the explicitly subscribed APNs, the following information shall be present:"
"For the Wildcard APN, the following information shall be present:"
    text-only


; Type: Grouped AVP
; Name: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
Non-3GPP-User-Data ::= < AVP header: 1500 10415 >
        [ Subscription-Id ] ;; corrected: (TS29.273.py#subscription-id-rule-8-2-3-1-non-3gpp-user-data)
        [ Non-3GPP-IP-Access ]
        [ Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN ]
      * [ RAT-Type ]
        [ Session-Timeout ]
        [ MIP6-Feature-Vector ]
        [ AMBR ]
        [ 3GPP-Charging-Characteristics ]
        [ Context-Identifier ]
        [ APN-OI-Replacement ]
      * [ APN-Configuration ]
        [ Trace-Info ]
        [ TWAN-Default-APN-Context-Id ]
      * [ TWAN-Access-Info ]
        [ UE-Usage-Type ]
        [ Emergency-Info ]
        [ ERP-Authorization ]
        [ Core-Network-Restrictions ]
        [ MPS-Priority ]
      * [ AVP ]


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-subscription-id)
; AVP: Subscription-Id
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The Subscription-ID, if present in this grouped AVP, shall contain either an MSISDN (if this identity is present in the subscription), or an External Identifier (if the subscriber does not have an MSISDN identity but has an External Identifier in the subscription)."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-ambr)
; AVP: AMBR
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The AMBR included in this grouped AVP shall include the AMBR associated to the user's subscription (UE-AMBR)."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-apn-oi-replacement)
; AVP: APN-OI-Replacement
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The APN-OI-Replacement included in this grouped AVP shall include the UE level APN-OI-Replacement associated to the user's subscription."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-apn-configuration)
; AVP: APN-Configuration
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP shall only contain APN-Configuration AVP(s) configured in the user subscription with an IP PDN type."
    excludes APN-Configuration/Non-IP-PDN-Type-Indicator = TRUE or APN-Configuration/Ethernet-PDN-Type-Indicator = TRUE
"If the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP is not empty, the Non-3GPP-IP-Acess AVP, the Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN AVP, the Context-Identifier AVP and at least one item of the APN-Configuration AVP shall always be included, except when the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP is used for downloading trace activation or deactivation information on the SWx interface, for an already registered user, or when the Non-3GPP-User-Data is used for downloading the Emergency-Info."
    present-if Non-3GPP-IP-Access and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Context-Identifier and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Subscription-Id and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or RAT-Type and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Session-Timeout and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or MIP6-Feature-Vector and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or AMBR and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or 3GPP-Charging-Characteristics and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or APN-OI-Replacement and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or TWAN-Default-APN-Context-Id and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or TWAN-Access-Info and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or UE-Usage-Type and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or ERP-Authorization and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Core-Network-Restrictions and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or MPS-Priority and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-context-identifier)
; AVP: Context-Identifier
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The Context-Identifier in this grouped AVP shall identify the user's default APN configuration."
    text-only
"If the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP is not empty, the Non-3GPP-IP-Acess AVP, the Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN AVP, the Context-Identifier AVP and at least one item of the APN-Configuration AVP shall always be included, except when the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP is used for downloading trace activation or deactivation information on the SWx interface, for an already registered user, or when the Non-3GPP-User-Data is used for downloading the Emergency-Info."
    present-if Non-3GPP-IP-Access and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or APN-Configuration and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Subscription-Id and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or RAT-Type and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Session-Timeout and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or MIP6-Feature-Vector and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or AMBR and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or 3GPP-Charging-Characteristics and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or APN-OI-Replacement and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or TWAN-Default-APN-Context-Id and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or TWAN-Access-Info and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or UE-Usage-Type and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or ERP-Authorization and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Core-Network-Restrictions and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or MPS-Priority and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-twan-default-apn-context-id)
; AVP: TWAN-Default-APN-Context-Id
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be present if the default APN configuration for EPC access over Trusted WLAN differs from the default APN configuration for 3GPP access and other non-3GPP accesses."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-rat-type)
; AVP: RAT-Type
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The RAT-Type AVP(s) shall include the access technology type(s) not allowed for the user"
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-emergency-info)
; AVP: Emergency-Info
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The Emergency-Info AVP shall contain the identity of the PDN-GW used for the establishment of emergency PDN connections."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-mps-priority)
; AVP: MPS-Priority
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The MPS-Priority AVP shall be present if an MPS subscription exists in the HSS for the UE."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-content)
; AVP: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"For the conditions specified in clause 8.1.2.3.2, the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP shall be empty, i.e. not include any AVP."
"If the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP is not empty, the Non-3GPP-IP-Acess AVP, the Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN AVP, the Context-Identifier AVP and at least one item of the APN-Configuration AVP shall always be included, except when the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP is used for downloading trace activation or deactivation information on the SWx interface, for an already registered user, or when the Non-3GPP-User-Data is used for downloading the Emergency-Info."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-non-3gpp-ip-access-when-not-empty)
; AVP: Non-3GPP-IP-Access
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"If the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP is not empty, the Non-3GPP-IP-Acess AVP, the Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN AVP, the Context-Identifier AVP and at least one item of the APN-Configuration AVP shall always be included, except when the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP is used for downloading trace activation or deactivation information on the SWx interface, for an already registered user, or when the Non-3GPP-User-Data is used for downloading the Emergency-Info."
    present-if Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Context-Identifier and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or APN-Configuration and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Subscription-Id and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or RAT-Type and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Session-Timeout and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or MIP6-Feature-Vector and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or AMBR and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or 3GPP-Charging-Characteristics and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or APN-OI-Replacement and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or TWAN-Default-APN-Context-Id and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or TWAN-Access-Info and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or UE-Usage-Type and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or ERP-Authorization and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Core-Network-Restrictions and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or MPS-Priority and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#non-3gpp-user-data-non-3gpp-ip-access-apn-when-not-empty)
; AVP: Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN
; Within: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Section: 8.2.3.1
; Page: 147
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"If the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP is not empty, the Non-3GPP-IP-Acess AVP, the Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN AVP, the Context-Identifier AVP and at least one item of the APN-Configuration AVP shall always be included, except when the Non-3GPP-User-Data AVP is used for downloading trace activation or deactivation information on the SWx interface, for an already registered user, or when the Non-3GPP-User-Data is used for downloading the Emergency-Info."
    present-if Non-3GPP-IP-Access and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Context-Identifier and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or APN-Configuration and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Subscription-Id and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or RAT-Type and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Session-Timeout and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or MIP6-Feature-Vector and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or AMBR and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or 3GPP-Charging-Characteristics and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or APN-OI-Replacement and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or TWAN-Default-APN-Context-Id and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or TWAN-Access-Info and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or UE-Usage-Type and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or ERP-Authorization and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or Core-Network-Restrictions and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info or MPS-Priority and not Trace-Info and not Emergency-Info


; Type: Grouped AVP
; Name: Subscription-Id
; Section: 8.2.3.2
; Page: 148
Subscription-Id ::= < AVP header: 443 >
        [ Subscription-Id-Type ]
        [ Subscription-Id-Data ]


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#subscription-id-type-values)
; AVP: Subscription-Id-Type
; Within: Subscription-Id
; Section: 8.2.3.2
; Page: 148
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"EPC shall make use only of the MSISDN and External Identifier values."
    exclude 1, 2, 4


; Type: Enumerated AVP
; Name: Non-3GPP-IP-Access
; Section: 8.2.3.3
; Page: 148
Non-3GPP-IP-Access ::= < Enumerated AVP header: 1501 10415 >
        NON_3GPP_SUBSCRIPTION_ALLOWED = 0
        NON_3GPP_SUBSCRIPTION_BARRED  = 1


; Type: Enumerated AVP
; Name: Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN
; Section: 8.2.3.4
; Page: 148
Non-3GPP-IP-Access-APN ::= < Enumerated AVP header: 1502 10415 >
        Non_3GPP_APNS_ENABLE  = 0
        Non_3GPP_APNS_DISABLE = 1


; Type: Grouped AVP
; Name: SIP-Auth-Data-Item
; Section: 8.2.3.9
; Page: 149
SIP-Auth-Data-Item ::= < AVP header: 612 10415 >
        [ SIP-Item-Number ]
        [ SIP-Authentication-Scheme ]
        [ SIP-Authenticate ]
        [ SIP-Authorization ]
        [ Confidentiality-Key ]
        [ Integrity-Key ]
      * [ AVP ]


; Type: Grouped AVP
; Name: Trace-Info
; Section: 8.2.3.13
; Page: 150
Trace-Info ::= < AVP header: 1505 10415 >
        [ Trace-Data ]
        [ Trace-Reference ]
      * [ AVP ]


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#trace-info-either)
; AVP: Trace-Info
; Section: 8.2.3.13
; Page: 150
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Either the Trace-Data or the Trace-Reference AVP shall be included."
    members at-least-one Trace-Data Trace-Reference


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#trace-info-trace-reference-or-trace-data)
; AVP: Trace-Reference
; Within: Trace-Info
; Section: 8.2.3.13
; Page: 150
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Either the Trace-Data or the Trace-Reference AVP shall be included."
    excludes Trace-Data


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-feature-list-id)
; AVP: Feature-List-ID
; Within: Supported-Features
; Application-ID: 16777265
; Section: 8.2.3.15
; Page: 150
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"For this release, the Feature-List-ID AVP value shall be set to 1 for the SWx application."
    values 1 if Vendor-Id = 10415


; Type: Value Table
; AVP: Feature-List
; Kind: features
; Feature-List-ID: 1
; Application: SWx
; Section: 8.2.3.16
; Table: 8.2.3.16/1
; Page: 150
"HSS Restoration"                    = 0 ; O
Access-Network-Information-Retrieval = 1 ; O
"UE Local Time Zone Retrieval"       = 2 ; O
"P-CSCF Restoration for WLAN"        = 3 ; O
"Emergency Services Continuity"      = 4 ; O
ERP                                  = 5 ; O
"Dedicated Core Networks"            = 6 ; O


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#swx-saa-dcn-ue-usage-type)
; AVP: Non-3GPP-User-Data
; Command: Server-Assignment-Answer
; Section: 8.2.3.16
; Table: 8.2.3.16/1
; Page: 150
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"If the 3GPP AAA Server does not indicate support of this feature in the SAR command, the HSS shall not send DCN-related subscription data (e.g., UE Usage Type) in SAA, and shall not send subsequent PPR commands when such subscription data are updated."
    excludes Non-3GPP-User-Data/UE-Usage-Type and not request/Supported-Features/Feature-List bit "Dedicated Core Networks"


; Type: Value Table
; AVP: PPR-Flags
; Kind: bits
; Section: 8.2.3.17
; Table: 8.2.3.17/1
; Page: 153
Reset-Indication             = 0
Access-Network-Info-Request  = 1
UE-Local-Time-Zone-Request   = 2
"P-CSCF Restoration Request" = 3


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#ppr-flags-undefined-bits)
; AVP: PPR-Flags
; Section: 8.2.3.17
; Table: 8.2.3.17/1
; Page: 153
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"NOTE: Bits not defined in this table shall be cleared by the sending HSS and discarded by the receiving 3GPP AAA Server."
    bits only 0 1 2 3


; Type: Grouped AVP
; Name: TWAN-Access-Info
; Section: 8.2.3.19
; Page: 153
TWAN-Access-Info ::= < AVP header: 1510 10415 >
        [ Access-Authorization-Flags ]
        [ WLAN-Identifier ]
      * [ AVP ]


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#twan-access-info-wlan-identifier)
; AVP: WLAN-Identifier
; Within: TWAN-Access-Info
; Section: 8.2.3.19
; Page: 153
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"If no WLAN-Identifier AVP is included in the TWAN-Access-Info AVP, the allowed access methods shall apply to any arbitrary Trusted WLAN."
    text-only
"A specific Trusted-WLAN shall appear in at most one TWAN-Access-Info AVP."
    unique
"There shall be at most one TWAN-Access-Info AVP not including any WLAN-Identifier."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#twan-access-info-access-authorization-flags-default)
; AVP: Access-Authorization-Flags
; Within: TWAN-Access-Info
; Section: 8.2.3.19
; Page: 153
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"If the Access-Authorization-Flags AVP is not present in the TWAN-Access-Info AVP, EPC access and Non-Seamless WLAN Offload shall be considered to be not allowed."
    default 0


; Type: Value Table
