; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-der-auth-request-type)
; AVP: Auth-Request-Type
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/1
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"AUTHORIZE_AUTHENTICATE shall be used in this case."
    range 3


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-der-visited-network-identifier)
; AVP: Visited-Network-Identifier
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/1
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present when the PGW Identity does not contain an FQDN."
    present-if MIP6-Agent-Info and not MIP6-Agent-Info/MIP-Home-Agent-Host


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-der-rat-type)
; AVP: RAT-Type
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/1
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall be present if it is available when the PDN GW sends the request."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-auth-request-type)
; AVP: Auth-Request-Type
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/2
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain the value AUTHORIZE_AUTHENTICATE."
    range 3


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-eap-master-session-key)
; AVP: EAP-Master-Session-Key
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/2
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present only if the result code is set to success."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-mip6-feature-vector)
; AVP: MIP6-Feature-Vector
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/2
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be present if the authorization was successful."
    present-if Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS
"None of the PMIP6_SUPPORTED or MIP4_SUPPORTED flags shall be set, since DSMIPv6 is used in this case."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-mobile-node-identifier)
; AVP: Mobile-Node-Identifier
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/2
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall only be sent if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS
"This IE shall not include the leading digit prepended in front of the IMSI used to differentiate between authentication schemes."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-apn-configuration)
; AVP: APN-Configuration
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/2
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall only be sent if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-mip6-agent-info)
; AVP: MIP6-Agent-Info
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/2
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall only be sent if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS_RELOCATE_HA indicating to the PDN GW that it shall initiate a HA switch procedure towards the UE."
    requires Result-Code = 2009


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-qos-resources)
; AVP: QoS-Resources
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/2
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be included only if the QoS-Capability AVP was received in the authorization request and the authorization succeeded."
    requires request/QoS-Capability
    requires Result-Code in 2000..2999
"The QoS profile template value in this IE shall be set to 0."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-redirect-host)
; AVP: Redirect-Host
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/2
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be sent if the Result-Code value is set to DIAMETER_REDIRECT_INDICATION."
    present-if Result-Code = DIAMETER_REDIRECT_INDICATION


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-an-trusted)
; AVP: AN-Trusted
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/2
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be present if the 3GPP AAA Server is able to make decision on whether the access network is Trusted or Untrusted."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-trace-info)
; AVP: Trace-Info
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.1
; Table: 9.1.2.1/2
; Page: 157
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be included if the subscriber and equipment trace has been activated for the user in the HSS and signalling based activation is to be used to download the trace activation from the HSS to the PDN GW."
    text-only
"Only the Trace-Data AVP shall be included to the Trace-Info AVP"
    members only Trace-Data


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dea-relocate-ha-mip6-agent-info)
; AVP: MIP6-Agent-Info
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.1.3
; Page: 162
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"If the HSS indicates that the user is currently being served by a different PDN GW, the 3GPP AAA Server shall respond to to the PDN GW with the Result-Code set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS_RELOCATE_HA and include the new assigned PDN GW identity in the MIP6-Agent-Info AVP."
    present-if Result-Code = 2009
    members at-least-one MIP-Home-Agent-Address MIP-Home-Agent-Host


