; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-rar-flags-p-cscf-restoration)
; AVP: RAR-Flags
; Command: Re-Auth-Request
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.5.1
; Page: 173
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
