"It shall be present when the PGW Identity does not contain an FQDN."
    present-if MIP6-Agent-Info and not MIP6-Agent-Info/MIP-Home-Agent-Host


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dsmip-aar-qos-capability)
; AVP: QoS-Capability
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.2.1
; Section: 9.1.2.5.1
; Table: 9.1.2.5.1/3
; Page: 173
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The PGW shall include this IE only during UE the initial attach."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dsmip-aaa-apn-configuration)
; AVP: APN-Configuration
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.2.2
; Section: 9.1.2.5.1
; Table: 9.1.2.5.1/4
; Page: 173
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall only be sent if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dsmip-aaa-trace-info)
; AVP: Trace-Info
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.2.2
; Section: 9.1.2.5.1
; Table: 9.1.2.5.1/4
; Page: 173
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Trace-data AVP shall be included (directly under the Trace-Info) if trace activation is requested"
"Trace-Reference AVP shall be included, if trace deactivation is requested."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-dsmip-aaa-an-trusted)
; AVP: AN-Trusted
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.2.2
; Section: 9.1.2.5.1
; Table: 9.1.2.5.1/4
; Page: 173
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be sent if this re-authorization procedure is triggered by the authentication and authorization via STa or SWm, when the 3GPP AAA Server detects that an S6b session already exists for the UE and the S6b session was established as a result of an authentication request for DSMIPv6."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-raa-result-code-authorize-authenticate)
; AVP: Result-Code
; Command: Re-Auth-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.1.2.5.2
; Page: 177
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"If it indicates AUTHORIZE_AUTHENTICATE, Result-Code shall be set to DIAMETER_INVALID_AVP_VALUE."
    excludes Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS and request/Re-Auth-Request-Type = AUTHORIZE_AUTHENTICATE


; Type: Information Elements
; Command: AA-Request ;; corrected: (TS29.273.py#elements-command-9-1-2-6-1-1)
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.1 ;; corrected: (TS29.273.py#elements-command-section-9-1-2-6-1-1)
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/1
; Page: 178
; Columns: Name                                  AVP                          Cat
"Permanent User Identity"                        User-Name                    M
"Authentication Request Type"                    Auth-Request-Type            M
"PDN GW Identity"                                MIP6-Agent-Info              O
"PGW PLMN ID"                                    Visited-Network-Identifier   C
"Mobility features"                              MIP6-Feature-Vector          M
APN                                              Service-Selection            C
"QoS capabilities"                               QoS-Capability               O
"Supported Features (See 3GPP TS 29.229 [24])"   Supported-Features           O
"MN-HA security parameter index"                 MIP-MN-HA-SPI                C


; Type: Information Elements
; Command: AA-Answer ;; corrected: (TS29.273.py#elements-command-9-1-2-6-1-2)
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.2 ;; corrected: (TS29.273.py#elements-command-section-9-1-2-6-1-2)
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/2
; Page: 178
; Columns: Name                                  AVP                   Cat
"Result code"                                    Result-Code           M
"Authentication Request Type"                    Auth-Request-Type     M
"Authorized mobility features"                   MIP6-Feature-Vector   C
"Session time"                                   Session-Timeout       C
"QoS resources"                                  QoS-Resources         C
"3GPP AAA Server URI"                            Redirect-Host         C
"Supported Features (See 3GPP TS 29.229 [24])"   Supported-Features    O
"MN-HA shared key"                               MIP-Session-Key       C
"APN Data"                                       APN-Configuration     C


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-mip4-aar-auth-request-type)
; AVP: Auth-Request-Type
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.1
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/1
; Page: 178
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"AUTHORIZE_ONLY shall be used in this case."
    range 2


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-mip4-aar-visited-network-identifier)
; AVP: Visited-Network-Identifier
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.1
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/1
; Page: 178
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present when the PGW Identity is present and does not contain an FQDN."
    present-if MIP6-Agent-Info and not MIP6-Agent-Info/MIP-Home-Agent-Host


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-mip4-aar-mip-mn-ha-spi)
; AVP: MIP-MN-HA-SPI
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.1
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/1
; Page: 178
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be included when the PDN-GW does not have the MN-HA shared key required to verify the MIPv4 RRQ message."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-mip4-aaa-auth-request-type)
; AVP: Auth-Request-Type
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.2
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/2
; Page: 178
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall contain the value AUTHORIZE_ONLY."
    range 2


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-mip4-aaa-mip6-feature-vector)
; AVP: MIP6-Feature-Vector
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.2
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/2
; Page: 178
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The 3GPP AAA Server shall insert this AVP if the authorization was successful."
    present-if Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS
"The MIP4_SUPPORTED flag shall be set."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-mip4-aaa-qos-resources)
; AVP: QoS-Resources
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.2
; Request-Section: 9.2.2.5.1
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/2
; Page: 178
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be included only if the QoS-Capability AVP was received in the authorization request and the authorization succeeded."
    requires request/QoS-Capability
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS
"The QoS profile template value in this IE shall be set to 0."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-mip4-aaa-redirect-host)
; AVP: Redirect-Host
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.2
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/2
; Page: 178
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be sent if the Result-Code value is set to DIAMETER_REDIRECT_INDICATION."
    present-if Result-Code = DIAMETER_REDIRECT_INDICATION


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-mip4-aaa-mip-session-key)
; AVP: MIP-Session-Key
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.2
; Request-Section: 9.2.2.5.1
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/2
; Page: 178
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"it shall be included if the Result-Code value is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS and the MIP-MN-HA-SPI was sent in the authorization request."
    present-if Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS and request/MIP-MN-HA-SPI


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-mip4-aaa-apn-configuration)
; AVP: APN-Configuration
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Command-Section: 9.2.2.5.2
; Section: 9.1.2.6.1
; Table: 9.1.2.6.1/2
; Page: 178
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall only be sent if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#visited-network-identifier-domain)
; AVP: Visited-Network-Identifier
; Section: 9.2.3.1.2
; Page: 189
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The AVP shall be encoded as:"
"mnc<MNC>.mcc<MCC>.3gppnetwork.org"
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-der-visited-network-identifier-domain)
; AVP: Visited-Network-Identifier
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777272
; Section: 9.2.3.1.2
; Page: 189
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The AVP shall be encoded as:"
"mnc<MNC>.mcc<MCC>.3gppnetwork.org"
"If MNC consists of only 2 digits, a leading digit \"0\" shall be added to the MNC value (e.g., if MNC=15 and MCC=234, the value of Visited-Network-Identifier shall be \"mnc015.mcc234.3gppnetwork.org\")."
    encoding plmn-domain
    length 29 octets


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#s6b-aar-visited-network-identifier-domain)
; AVP: Visited-Network-Identifier
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777272
