; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#eca-equipment-status)
; AVP: Equipment-Status
; Section: 11.1.2.1.1
; Table: 11.1.2.1.1/2
; Page: 196
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present if the result of the ME Identity Check is DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.273.dadx#eir-terminal-information)
; AVP: Terminal-Information
; Section: 11.1.2.1.1
; Table: 11.1.2.1.1/1
; Page: 196
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
